# AI Gateway credentials for the /api/chat route.
#
# The chat panel streams through the Vercel AI SDK using gateway-style model
# IDs (e.g. "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5"), so a gateway key is required for
# the Agent/Ask modes to respond. Without it the panel renders an error.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in a real value:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# Optional: when deploying on Vercel with the AI Gateway OIDC flow, the token
# is injected automatically and AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY can be left unset.
# VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN=
